Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.312 --> 00:00:02.423
- Are you eating a burger or
are you eating a sandwich?

00:00:02.423 --> 00:00:05.840
The chopped cheese is like, I don't know.

00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:12.482
