00:00:12.482 --> 00:00:15.618
Can you put it in a sentence for me?

00:00:15.618 --> 00:00:18.201
(upbeat music)

00:01:01.132 --> 00:01:02.314
- First glance kind of thing,

00:01:02.314 --> 00:01:04.393
I'm assuming it's just like a

00:01:04.393 --> 00:01:06.883
selection of chopped cheeses,

00:01:06.883 --> 00:01:08.754
but that sounds like way too easy, right?

00:01:08.754 --> 00:01:10.059
- I'm guessing it's a sandwich

00:01:10.059 --> 00:01:11.893
since we're always
talking about delis now.

00:01:11.893 --> 00:01:14.257
- I'm from Texas, we don't have that.

00:01:14.257 --> 00:01:15.643
When someone said, "Are
you going to the Bodega?"

00:01:15.643 --> 00:01:17.635
I said, "Who is she? I
don't know who she is."

00:01:17.635 --> 00:01:20.218
(upbeat music)

00:01:22.872 --> 00:01:24.254
- Sweet.

00:01:24.254 --> 00:01:25.554
- There's ketchup on it.

00:01:25.554 --> 00:01:26.387
- I'm not a ketchup person.

00:01:26.387 --> 00:01:27.220
- Neither am I.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.243
- I love me a good pressed sandwich.

00:01:28.243 --> 00:01:29.076
Because when I was little,

00:01:29.076 --> 00:01:31.079
I used to press my
sandwiches together anyway,

00:01:31.079 --> 00:01:32.533
so I love that they did that for me.

00:01:32.533 --> 00:01:34.468
- Man, I'm excited to know
what this is gonna taste like.

00:01:34.468 --> 00:01:35.301
- Cheers.

00:01:35.301 --> 00:01:36.134
- Cheers.

00:01:40.617 --> 00:01:41.920
- Mhhh!

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:42.753
- MM!

00:01:44.083 --> 00:01:45.505
- This is banging!

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:47.380
- It's as if you grilled onions,

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:49.620
sweet onions in there chopped
up with the ground beef.

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:51.209
Homestyle Bubba Burgers.

00:01:51.209 --> 00:01:52.433
- The mayonaise and tomato

00:01:52.433 --> 00:01:54.917
add a little tang to it,
which is really good.

00:01:54.917 --> 00:01:56.958
- This is like a circus in this piece.

00:01:56.958 --> 00:01:58.503
- Oh (bleep) wait, is that ketchup?

00:01:58.503 --> 00:02:00.296
- This would go so well with fries.

00:02:00.296 --> 00:02:01.762
- Very minimal mess.

00:02:01.762 --> 00:02:03.346
- If you like philly cheesesteaks,

00:02:03.346 --> 00:02:04.609
and you like cheeseburgers,

00:02:04.609 --> 00:02:06.071
you will like chopped cheese.

00:02:06.071 --> 00:02:06.966
- Why do I do this to myself?

00:02:06.966 --> 00:02:08.430
Why did I wait so long?

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:11.001
- I would give it a hard seven out of six.

00:02:11.001 --> 00:02:13.974
- It's $4? Catch me getting three of this,

00:02:13.974 --> 00:02:17.112
for breakfast, lunch, and dinner.

00:02:17.112 --> 00:02:17.945
- Mmm.

00:02:21.226 --> 00:02:25.343
- I would 100% buy this
on my next bodegaventure.

00:02:25.343 --> 00:02:26.769
- If I ever am in Harlem,

00:02:26.769 --> 00:02:28.680
this is probably like my first stop.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:30.307
- Chopped cheese at Bodegas.

00:02:30.307 --> 00:02:31.163
- At Bodegas.

00:02:31.163 --> 00:02:32.101
- I love Bodegas.

00:02:32.101 --> 00:02:33.851
- I enjoyed this even
though it had ketchup on it,

00:02:33.851 --> 00:02:35.764
which I think is a really
glowing recommendation.

00:02:35.764 --> 00:02:37.718
