00:02:39.183 --> 00:02:40.893
as far as food

00:02:40.893 --> 00:02:42.397
and so I'm gonna give them a chance.

00:02:42.397 --> 00:02:43.336
- Go New York!

00:02:43.336 --> 00:02:44.758
- New York chopped cheese right here.

00:02:44.758 --> 00:02:46.106
(bleep)ing love it.

00:02:46.106 --> 00:02:47.778
